WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.675
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Jake. Welcome to Online A two, Book three.

2
00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:09.037
Hi! I'm Sreypich. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.337 --> 00:00:16.377
Unit twenty-three: Setting Goals. In this unit, you will make a plan with steps and a deadline.

4
00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:18.083
Goal.

5
00:00:18.783 --> 00:00:21.038
Goal means something you want to achieve.

6
00:00:21.338 --> 00:00:23.488
My goal is to read twenty books.

7
00:00:24.188 --> 00:00:26.956
Your turn. Say: Goal.

8
00:00:29.656 --> 00:00:30.449
Goal.

9
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:32.265
Plan.

10
00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:35.789
Plan means a list of things you will do to reach a goal.

11
00:00:36.089 --> 00:00:38.100
I made a plan for my English study.

12
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.604
Your turn. Say: Plan.

13
00:00:44.304 --> 00:00:45.061
Plan.

14
00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:46.842
Step.

15
00:00:47.542 --> 00:00:49.646
Step means one action in a plan.

16
00:00:49.946 --> 00:00:52.108
The first step is to learn ten words a week.

17
00:00:52.808 --> 00:00:55.472
Your turn. Say: Step.

18
00:00:58.172 --> 00:00:58.848
Step.

19
00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:00.723
Achieve.

20
00:01:01.423 --> 00:01:04.259
Achieve means to reach a goal after hard work.

21
00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:06.106
I achieved my goal!

22
00:01:06.806 --> 00:01:09.446
Your turn. Say: Achieve.

23
00:01:12.146 --> 00:01:13.020
Achieve.

24
00:01:14.017 --> 00:01:14.936
Practise.

25
00:01:15.636 --> 00:01:18.716
Practise means to do something again and again to get better.

26
00:01:19.016 --> 00:01:20.980
I practise speaking every day.

27
00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.275
Your turn. Say: Practise.

28
00:01:26.975 --> 00:01:27.895
Practise.

29
00:01:28.883 --> 00:01:29.873
Progress.

30
00:01:30.573 --> 00:01:32.979
Progress means getting better step by step.

31
00:01:33.279 --> 00:01:35.394
I'm making good progress in math.

32
00:01:36.094 --> 00:01:38.758
Your turn. Say: Progress.

33
00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:42.483
Progress.

34
00:01:43.483 --> 00:01:44.333
Reward.

35
00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:47.544
Reward means something nice you get for doing well.

36
00:01:47.844 --> 00:01:49.692
My reward is a trip to the beach.

37
00:01:50.392 --> 00:01:52.511
Your turn. Say: Reward.

38
00:01:55.211 --> 00:01:56.119
Reward.

39
00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:57.886
Future.

40
00:01:58.586 --> 00:02:00.469
Future means the time that will come.

41
00:02:00.769 --> 00:02:02.757
Goals help us build a good future.

42
00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:06.156
Your turn. Say: Future.

43
00:02:08.856 --> 00:02:09.729
Future.

44
00:02:10.717 --> 00:02:12.832
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:14.876
Sreypich, what's your goal this year?

46
00:02:16.183 --> 00:02:18.531
I want to pass the B1 test by June.

47
00:02:19.817 --> 00:02:20.911
What's your plan?

48
00:02:22.217 --> 00:02:25.122
Step one: I want to learn ten new words by Friday.

49
00:02:26.417 --> 00:02:28.230
How will you check your progress?

50
00:02:29.517 --> 00:02:33.388
I'll take a practice test every month. My reward is a new book!

51
00:02:34.683 --> 00:02:37.112
Grammar focus: I want to by.

52
00:02:37.412 --> 00:02:39.458
I want to read ten books by December.

53
00:02:39.758 --> 00:02:43.723
'By' + a time means 'not later than' that time. It's your deadline!

54
00:02:44.717 --> 00:02:47.741
Now read and listen. My Plan for Success.

55
00:02:48.041 --> 00:02:50.818
Last month, I set a goal for my English.

56
00:02:52.117 --> 00:02:54.662
I want to speak confidently by the end of the year.

57
00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:59.401
My plan has small steps, like learning ten words every week.

58
00:03:00.717 --> 00:03:04.504
I practise every day, and I check my progress every month.

59
00:03:05.817 --> 00:03:09.163
When I achieve my goal, my reward will be a trip to Kep!

60
00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.905
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:13.205 --> 00:03:15.437
I want to finish my book blank Friday.

62
00:03:15.737 --> 00:03:18.694
A, by. B, in. C, on to.

63
00:03:22.683 --> 00:03:24.776
The answer is A: by.

64
00:03:26.283 --> 00:03:28.329
One action in a plan is a blank.

65
00:03:28.629 --> 00:03:32.434
A, step. B, reward. C, goal.

66
00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.217
The answer is A: step.

67
00:03:39.717 --> 00:03:42.297
To reach a goal after hard work is to blank.

68
00:03:42.597 --> 00:03:46.622
A, achieve. B, practise. C, plan.

69
00:03:50.617 --> 00:03:53.034
The answer is A: achieve.

70
00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:58.540
Now it's your turn to speak. What is your goal? What is your plan?

71
00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:09.163
I want to read twenty English books by December. My first step is to read for twenty minutes every day.

72
00:04:09.463 --> 00:04:11.323
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

73
00:04:12.317 --> 00:04:16.246
Great work today! You learned eight new words and i want to by.

74
00:04:16.546 --> 00:04:21.044
Today's value is determination. Keep going step by step until you reach your goal.

75
00:04:21.344 --> 00:04:23.904
See you in Unit twenty-four. Goodbye!

76
00:04:24.204 --> 00:04:26.566
Thank you, Mr. Jake! Bye, everyone!

